# nalam.me

Read `AGENTS.md` for the current editing map and required branch-specific guides;
`CONTEXT.md` defines source, staged build, public artifact and managed root output.

Astro produces static documents with small React islands. `yarn build` validates a
candidate at `dist/public` and updates local Firebase CSP hashes; GitHub Pages still
serves the incumbent committed root files. `yarn publish:root` is a dry-run. Root
application, commit/push and remote deployment require the user's release instruction.
Never empty or mirror-delete the mixed repository root.

For content or route changes, read `docs/operations/authoring.md`. For publication,
recovery or future Firebase Hosting, read `docs/operations/publication.md`.
[ADR-0009](../../docs/adr/0009-astro-staged-publication.md) records the migration;
earlier ADRs preserve the original decisions and dated amendments.
